# The Rootcore's acid seep (CIPlay the_rootcore_acid, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...'): the green pool at the end of the
# side cut off the core room (recipe -25.4 4.05, floor 1.5). Without the suit (CIGapsSuit off) the seep burns.
# The suit run is the_rootcore_acidsuit.
island The Rootcore keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at -25.4 4.05 h=2.3
wait 5
expect message The seep water burns.
at -25.4 4.05 h=2.3
wait 4
# (5 a second for ~9 s: at least 20)
expect hurt 20
# out of the cut onto the room's floor
walk -25.4 4.05 to -23 4.6 to -21 5.5 below=20
